# recipe4.dag - keep training past the access point's limit on a job's total time.
#
#     condor_submit_dag recipe4.dag
#
# One training job (job_ospool.sub) at a time. When it ends:
#   exit 0  (finished)               -> the DAG is done
#   exit 86 (continue in a new job)  -> handoff.sh moves its checkpoints to resume/, and RETRY
#                                       submits the same job again: a new job, with a fresh
#                                       time limit, that continues from resume/
#   anything else (an error)         -> the DAG stops, so you can look at job.err
#
# RETRY 50: at most 50 new jobs (on ap40, 50 x 14 days). Raise it if you need more.

JOB train job_ospool.sub
SCRIPT PRE  train handoff.sh pre
SCRIPT POST train handoff.sh post $RETURN
RETRY train 50 UNLESS-EXIT 2
